{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-03","example":{"issue":{"title":"巷道匯入幹道，來車與轉向是否容易辨識？","intro":"主要道路約 24 m、次要道路約 8 m，路側含停車與步行空間。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-03-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-03-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-03-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-03-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"warning","title":"主次道路提示不足","text":"主要道路缺少提醒駕駛留意巷道來車的警示。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限資訊不完整","text":"主要道路缺少速限提示；次要道路只有標字，未搭配標誌。"},{"id":"turn","title":"缺少右轉空間","text":"路口未清楚安排右轉車輛的行進與等待空間。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[44,45],"strategy":{"title":"整理巷道匯入與路側空間","intro":"將行人、停車、公車停靠與巷道匯入的位置一起安排。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-03-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"walking","title":"串接人行空間","text":"調整過寬車道與路肩，留出人行空間，並以路緣外擴整理轉角。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"parking","title":"分清停車與行車","text":"配置嵌入式汽車停車位及斜角機車格，減少進出車位的干擾。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"entry","title":"讓匯入口保持清楚","text":"以車道彎曲提醒減速，並在巷道匯入口劃設網狀線，提示保持淨空。","moduleId":"M2-04"},{"id":"bus","title":"安排公車停靠範圍","text":"配合人行道外擴，整理公車彎與停靠區標線。","moduleId":"M3-04"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-03-unsignalized-urban-merge-t.typ","sha256":"2f2b316af81f73cca010e9c444fbf418ff223098534e32b6324ec478460362b3","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-03-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-03/G1-03_現況圖_01.png","width":3463,"height":2225,"label":"G1-03 現況圖","scenario":"G1-03","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":44,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image32.png","sha256":"5462184bdc4e2381fc271d481c9e2f1cc1121a19d27b35f60abbb4965db73f2d"},"results:g1-03-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-03/G1-03_現況照片_01.png","width":2581,"height":1417,"label":"G1-03 現況照片","scenario":"G1-03","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":45,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image34.png","sha256